# Frontend Rules

## Next.js 16

This is NOT the Next.js from older training data. Read [frontend/AGENTS.md](../../frontend/AGENTS.md) and `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before writing code.

## Layout

- App Router: `frontend/src/app/`
- Components: `frontend/src/components/`
- Path alias: `@/` (configured in `vitest.config.ts`)

## Verify

```powershell
cd frontend
npm run lint
npm test
npm run build
```

## API proxy

Production/demo uses `/api/v1` proxy to backend. Check env and CORS when touching auth or API routes.

## Testing

- Vitest + Testing Library; setup in `vitest.setup.ts`
- E2E (when available): Playwright per task V39
